  54:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_xspi.c ****             (see the XSPI memory data sheet)
  55:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_xspi.c ****        (++) The configuration of the interface between peripheral and memory is done by
  56:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_xspi.c ****             the function BSP_XSPI_NOR_ConfigFlash(), three modes are possible :
  57:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_xspi.c ****             - SPI : instruction, address and data on one line
  58:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_xspi.c ****             - STR OPI : instruction, address and data on eight lines with sampling on one edge of c
